        "code": {
          "text": "Neck range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mildly reduced rotation, limited by discomfort."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Musculoskeletal examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Palpable taut bands and trigger points in the upper trapezius and cervical/thoracic paraspinals reproduce the patient's typical pain. No midline spinal tenderness. Shoulders have full range of motion with mild discomfort at extremes; strength 5/5. Localised thoracic/lumbar paraspinal myofascial tenderness; no bony tenderness or step."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
